<h2 id="apps-heading">Industry Applications</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Electronics:</strong> PCB assembly, device assembly, testing, and packaging. ESD-safe belt conveyors and pallet transfer systems. <a href="/industries/pharmaceutical-conveyors/">Cleanroom-compatible</a> for semiconductor handling.</li>
<li><strong>Medical devices:</strong> Precision assembly of syringes, inhalers, diagnostic devices. Pallet transfer with validated positioning. cGMP documentation requirements.</li>
<li><strong><a href="/industries/automotive-conveyors/">Automotive</a>:</strong> Component assembly for modules, battery packs, electronic control units. Chain-on-edge and overhead conveyors for body shop and paint operations.</li>
<li><strong>Consumer products:</strong> Appliance assembly, toy assembly, cosmetics kitting. Workstation belt conveyors with ergonomic accessories.</li>
<li><strong>Aerospace:</strong> Component assembly and inspection. Low-volume, high-precision pallet transfer systems with full traceability.</li>
</ul>
